(Japanese: '''ジョジョ島''' ''Jojo Island'') is an {{pkmn|anime}}-exclusive location between the [[Hoenn]] cities of [[Mossdeep City]] and [[Sootopolis City]]. It is the setting of the worldwide [[banned episodes|banned episode]] [[AG101 (unaired)]].

A {{pkmn2|wild}} group of {{p|Whiscash}} were causing massive earthquakes across Jojo Island. {{Ash}} and {{ashfr}} joined forces with a local boy named Chōta to combat the Whiscash.

